-- title:
--   Omega and agemo subgroups
-- statement:
--   Introduces the omega subgroups $\Omega_n(G)$, absent from Mathlib, which are needed for Bender–Glauberman §1 (Thm 1.11, Cor 1.12, Thm 1.13 on Thompson critical subgroups), §4 (rank theory), §5 (narrow $p$-groups) and Isaacs Thm 4.36.
--
--   Main definitions: `Omega` ($\Omega_n(G)$ at the prime $p$, generated by $\{g: g^{p^n}=1\}$, shown characteristic), `Agemo` (the agemo subgroup $\mho_n(G)$, BG's $\mathcal{U}^n(G)$, also characteristic), and `omega1OfAbelian` ($\Omega_1$ of an abelian subgroup).
--
--   The bundle also proves 10 supporting lemmas used by later statements.
